Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.86,0:01:53.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum Bazooka!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.57,0:01:54.88,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.88,0:01:57.65,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CABAJI]\NWe have to retreat!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.68,0:02:00.69,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[MOHJI]\NWe're doomed!\NRun for your lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.02,0:02:04.96,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[CROWD yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.64,0:02:08.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is everyone here?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.91,0:02:10.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, buddy check.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.21,0:02:12.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sound off if you think\Nyou're missing yours.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.61,0:02:13.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.85,0:02:15.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got mine.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.08,0:02:16.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE C]\NRight here.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.21,0:02:17.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.92,0:02:19.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE E]\NCaptain Buggy\Ndidn't make it back.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.95,0:02:22.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not all here!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.83,0:02:28.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At last my flashy raft\Nis finished!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.50,0:02:37.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NI swear, I'll get you!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.48,0:02:45.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.13,0:02:47.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bad luck just\Nmakes me stronger!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.90,0:02:51.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lunch time!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.15,0:03:04.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[shrieks]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.59,0:03:13.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[BUGGY]\NChop Chop Harpoon!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.24,0:03:19.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[shrieks]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.61,0:03:21.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NJust accept it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.99,0:03:23.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your time has come.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.81,0:03:25.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.89,0:03:30.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BIG BLUE BIRD grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.39,0:03:32.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.21,0:03:33.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NHe-heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.42,0:03:36.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was just a joke!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.55,0:03:37.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NForgive me! Aaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.35,0:03:39.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.38,0:03:53.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.90,0:03:55.87,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NCloser... closer.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.03,0:03:57.96,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,My plan is perfection.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.96,0:04:02.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BIG BLUE BIRD squawks]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.29,0:04:04.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NStupid bird! Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.62,0:04:10.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[giggles]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.01,0:04:12.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha! I got you!\NOh crap. You got me.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.94,0:04:14.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.88,0:04:16.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.56,0:04:17.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.00,0:04:20.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(308.5,1053)}- [YELLOW BIRD A, B grunt]\N- [BUGGY] Ow. Ow. Ow. Ow.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.30,0:04:21.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NStop it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The end is near...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.20,0:04:25.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[coughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.16,0:04:42.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.46,0:04:44.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[rustling]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.09,0:04:46.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NYou must leave!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.55,0:04:48.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NSays who?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.19,0:04:50.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you want to live\Nyou must leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.20,0:04:57.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are these things?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.73,0:05:00.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NThese are\Nthe animals of the forest.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.06,0:05:03.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you touch them,\Nyou will be annihilated.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.10,0:05:05.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow... These guys are flashy.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.78,0:05:06.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's okay...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.82,0:05:09.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON grunts]\NI warned you\Nnot to take another step.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.78,0:05:12.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gunshot]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.86,0:05:16.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NHow dare you shoot at me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.09,0:05:17.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NCrap. I missed.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.28,0:05:19.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NAh-ha! There you are!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.62,0:05:21.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NUh! What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.12,0:05:24.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.09,0:05:26.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now get out here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.15,0:05:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON groans]\NYou have Devil Fruit Powers!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.20,0:05:32.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what if I do.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.82,0:05:36.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just a...\Nuh... you're just a...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.73,0:05:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.23,0:05:44.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like a... a jack-in-the-box\Nor something?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.45,0:05:49.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, ironically I am\Nin a box and my name is...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.20,0:05:52.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, you idiot!\NI'm a person not a toy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.71,0:05:55.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Also... I will kill you\Nif you go anywhere near
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.66,0:05:57.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my precious animals,\Nso watch it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.82,0:06:00.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will not hesitate\Nto put you down.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.49,0:06:02.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh... You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.46,0:06:06.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I admire your stupidity\Neven if it gets you killed.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.59,0:06:08.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.27,0:06:11.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.37,0:06:13.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.37,0:06:16.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HIPPORILLA exhales]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.40,0:06:18.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NDamn you!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.18,0:06:24.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's no fair using weapons!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.43,0:06:27.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NThen what the hell\Ndo you call this?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.38,0:06:29.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.20,0:06:31.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NSay your prayers,\Nand say them fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.43,0:06:32.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gunshots]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.41,0:06:43.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.86,0:06:49.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Chop Chop Quick Escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.16,0:06:51.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.97,0:07:08.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's too bad for you,\Nbut I can't allow anyone to live
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.77,0:07:11.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who tries to hurt these animals.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.03,0:07:13.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only reason anyone ever\Ncomes to this island
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.29,0:07:15.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is to take\Nthese precious animals.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.85,0:07:19.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NUgh. Why would I care\Nabout some stupid animals?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.75,0:07:20.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.49,0:07:24.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... then you're not a poacher?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.10,0:07:38.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what'd you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.23,0:07:40.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's some pretty good sake\Nif I don't say so myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.99,0:07:43.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NOoh, it's the best.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.21,0:07:46.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's been awhile\Nsince I've had a good drink.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.62,0:07:48.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NHave as much as you'd like.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.18,0:07:50.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can always make more.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.22,0:07:53.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that\Nmisunderstanding earlier.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.20,0:07:55.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NAll of that's behind us now.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.66,0:07:57.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No need to mention it again.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.67,0:07:59.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[GAIMON, BUGGY]\N– Cheers!\N– Cheers!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.34,0:08:05.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON, BUGGY laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.88,0:08:11.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NThanks for helping me\Nrebuild my flashy raft.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.82,0:08:14.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NNo problem, my friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.42,0:08:17.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I like working with my hands.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again someday.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.53,0:08:21.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NI'd like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.89,0:08:25.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY sniffs]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.60,0:08:30.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON sniffs, sobs]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.68,0:08:36.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Goodbye... my friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.06,0:08:38.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.99,0:08:44.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NGoodbye!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.11,0:08:50.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NSet sail!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.97,0:08:54.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha haaa!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.24,0:08:57.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NBuggy...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.08,0:09:03.68,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I forgot to\Nwarn you about the monsters.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.11,0:09:07.71,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,But I know you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.27,0:09:14.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, go the other way!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.50,0:09:17.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.34,0:09:21.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.47,0:09:23.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's just great.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.27,0:09:26.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Swim! Go Buggy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.44,0:09:28.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.04,0:09:32.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey... Get outta there!\NHe looks hungry!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.94,0:09:36.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAIMON]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.67,0:09:38.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.34,0:09:46.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.87,0:10:02.94,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NOh, she's hot.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.73,0:10:05.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.76,0:10:08.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen a woman\Nin over twenty years.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.14,0:10:11.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... that's a\Npirate's luck for ya
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.38,0:10:12.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if I've ever seen it.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.55,0:10:16.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And to think\NI was worried about him.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.00,0:10:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.28,0:10:23.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have a good time,\Nyou lucky bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.74,0:10:28.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I owe you one.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.29,0:10:31.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought I was\Na goner for sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.93,0:10:34.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's really no big deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.47,0:10:37.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy...\Nthe Pirate Clown, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.81,0:10:41.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's it to you?\NJust who are you, lady?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.79,0:10:44.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for\Na certain young pirate.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.09,0:10:46.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think you know him.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.95,0:10:50.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yells]\NThat's him! Stupid brat.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.70,0:10:52.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just wait till\NI get my hands on you.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.06,0:10:54.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.61,0:10:59.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Is that the guy\Nyou're looking for?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.30,0:11:02.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NI see. Now I understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.34,0:11:05.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that's why you saved my life.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.86,0:11:09.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So then... What'd ya say?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.06,0:11:15.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hell yes. We both want to kill
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.02,0:11:18.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the same stupid kid,\Nso we should work together.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.30,0:11:21.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's great. Let's drink on it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.49,0:11:22.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NCheers.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(440,1053)}- [BUGGY laughs]\N- [ALVIDA chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.73,0:11:34.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE D]\NCaptain Buggy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.93,0:11:38.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sobbing]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.03,0:11:40.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE B]\NBefore he died,\NI hated Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.27,0:11:42.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I always thought he was\Ncruel and heartless.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.70,0:11:44.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But now I see\Nhow hard he worked.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.61,0:11:47.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He really just wanted\Nwhat was best for his crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.91,0:11:49.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With Captain Buggy\Nwe were able to
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.84,0:11:51.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,pillage and plunder\Nto our hearts content.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.61,0:11:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it'll be\Nthe same with another captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.68,0:11:57.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's honor our missing leader.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.51,0:12:00.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He deserves a flashy\Ngoodbye from us.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.58,0:12:01.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MOHJI, RICHIE sobbing]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.95,0:12:05.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CABAJI]\NRest in peace... captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.39,0:12:08.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.\NYour faithful number two.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.14,0:12:12.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cabaji the Acrobat\Nis ready to take your place.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.44,0:12:14.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MOHJI]\NHmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.37,0:12:15.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CABAJI]\NI will take the helm and lead
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.37,0:12:17.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the Buggy Pirates\Nback on the path to glory.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.79,0:12:19.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MOHJI]\NStop right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.81,0:12:22.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cabaji!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.36,0:12:23.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is I, Beast Tamer Mohji,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.96,0:12:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the captain's\Nright hand man who should
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,take his proper place\Nas our leader.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.90,0:12:29.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've always been\Nthe next in line
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.40,0:12:32.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and nobody is going\Nto take that away from me.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.40,0:12:35.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1\i0}I'll be glad to take you\Nas my second in command,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.37,0:12:38.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. All right then,\Nlooks like we'll have a fight
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.55,0:12:40.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to see who'll be\Nthe next captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.65,0:12:41.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.38,0:12:42.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's just fine by me.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.97,0:12:45.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES chuckle]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.80,0:12:53.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES chanting]\N– Mohji! Mohji! Mohji!\N– Mohji! Mohji! Mohji!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.66,0:12:56.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES chanting]\N– Cabaji! Cabaji! Cabaji!\N– Cabaji! Cabaji! Cabaji!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.76,0:12:58.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES chanting]\N– Mohji! Mohji!\N– Mohji! Mohji!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.54,0:13:00.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cabaji! Cabaji!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.41,0:13:02.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mohji! Mohji!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.59,0:13:04.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cabaji! Cabaji!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.47,0:13:07.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mohji! Mohji!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.12,0:13:26.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CABAJI]\NI guess we'll settle\Nthis the old-fashioned way.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.48,0:13:28.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hand to hand combat.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't have\Nit any other way.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.49,0:13:33.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I get to tear you\Napart limb from limb.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.22,0:13:48.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[muffled]\NIt's no use. Just give up.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.29,0:13:50.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know... you can't\Ntake it... anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.89,0:13:54.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[muffled]\NI didn't understand\Nanything you just said.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.21,0:14:22.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– Richie! The greatest captain ever!\N– Richie! The greatest captain ever!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.80,0:14:53.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES]\N– Captain Richie! Captain Richie!\N– Captain Richie! Captain Richie!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.50,0:14:54.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's the Greatest!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.80,0:14:56.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE D]\NAfter the loss of Captain Buggy,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.44,0:14:58.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Richie is the one\Nwho will lead us now!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.04,0:15:00.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All hail Captain Richie!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.48,0:15:15.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES continue chanting]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.32,0:15:17.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES chant]\N– He's the greatest! He's a lion!\N– He's the greatest! He's a lion!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.99,0:15:24.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Richie! Captain Richie!\NHe's the greatest! He's a lion!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.97,0:15:31.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheer]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.94,0:15:42.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are trespassing.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.50,0:15:44.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This island belongs\Nto the Bear Claw Tribe
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.08,0:15:45.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and you will be shown no mercy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.13,0:15:48.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help, captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.43,0:15:55.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BEAR CLAW A]\NThen we shall\Nfight to the death.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.94,0:16:16.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We surrender.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.16,0:16:24.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you find something?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.16,0:16:26.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look. That's my ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.90,0:16:31.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Flashy Flagship\Nof the Buggy Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.63,0:16:34.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NBut who would do this?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.13,0:16:36.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who would use\Nsuch an old picture?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.74,0:16:40.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NAnd what did they bury?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.47,0:16:44.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. There's somebody passed out\Non the ground over there.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.48,0:16:46.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NNo!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.63,0:16:48.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mohji! Cabaji?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.61,0:16:50.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell\Nhappened to you two?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cap-Captain Buggy...!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.98,0:16:58.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NYou're alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.31,0:17:01.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never leave us again!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.71,0:17:05.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CABAJI]\NWe thought\Nyou were gone forever!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.73,0:17:08.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I missed you guys so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.38,0:17:13.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... uh...\NWho kicked your asses?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.05,0:17:15.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd like to say hello!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.16,0:17:18.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh...\NI don't remember anything
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.46,0:17:20.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,except getting knocked out.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.80,0:17:25.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were attacked.\NBut I have no idea who did it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.64,0:17:27.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALVIDA]\NLooks like your boys\Nhave been introduced
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.64,0:17:29.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the Bear Claw Tribe.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.29,0:17:33.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We better hurry up\Nif you want to save your crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.47,0:17:34.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL shriek]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.78,0:17:37.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Bear Claws are cannibals.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.68,0:17:51.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES, RICHIE yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.45,0:17:54.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Took a crap in the pot.\NYou can't eat us now.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.45,0:17:56.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I peed myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.24,0:17:58.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'd all be dry\Nand stringy anyway.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.96,0:18:00.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just eat this guy.\NHe looks tasty.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.97,0:18:03.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's got much more meat on\Nhis bones than I do. Eat him!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.89,0:18:07.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't happening.\NThis isn't happening!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.89,0:18:11.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NIt'll all be over soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.40,0:18:12.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're the Bear Claw Tribe.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.90,0:18:15.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We know how to prepare anyone\Nto taste quite delicious!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.90,0:18:18.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES holler]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.50,0:18:22.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do\Nwith these things?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.54,0:18:23.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Appetizers?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.71,0:18:26.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure those chunks\Nwould be very good to eat.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.48,0:18:27.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BEAR CLAW D]\NGive them to the dog.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.85,0:18:29.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sniffs]\NNo way.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.41,0:18:31.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think it might\Nmake him throw up.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.25,0:18:33.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[BUGGY]\NChop, chop...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.92,0:18:37.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BEAR CLAWS gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.39,0:18:39.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[BUGGY]\NChop, chop, chop, chop...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.49,0:19:08.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NIt can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}chop-chop, chop-chop,\NFlashy Reassemble!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.14,0:19:26.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.40,0:19:44.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.84,0:19:50.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE holler, cheer]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.36,0:19:54.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now...\Nmy favorite! Showtime!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.20,0:19:57.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Super Flashy Buggy Ball!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.63,0:19:58.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.72,0:20:04.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BEAR CLAWS yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.57,0:20:09.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whistles]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.15,0:20:11.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MOHJI]\NRichie!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.62,0:20:14.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.69,0:20:20.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[CABAJI]\NAcrobat Technique:
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.55,0:20:22.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Extreme Wrath at the Steam Bath!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.19,0:20:28.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time for\Nthe Beast Tamer Mohji!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.07,0:20:30.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[RICHIE roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.56,0:20:32.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.94,0:20:35.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1\i0}I'm Captain Buggy\Nthe Clown Pirate!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.00,0:20:37.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1\i0}You didn't really think you'd\Nbe able to hurt me, did you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.84,0:20:39.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BEAR CLAWS gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.78,0:20:41.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your tribe has done\Nsuch a good job
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.51,0:20:44.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,looking after my men.\NLet me give you your reward.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.95,0:20:46.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here I come, boys!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.85,0:20:48.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.61,0:20:50.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Chop-Chop Kick!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.55,0:20:55.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BEAR CLAW D, E groan]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.98,0:20:59.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Aah! Chop-Chop... Punch!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.65,0:21:02.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Try to eat us now!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.04,0:21:06.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.80,0:21:13.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheer]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.60,0:21:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you. You saved us.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.47,0:21:18.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My adorable little children.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.41,0:21:20.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've missed you all\Nso very much.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.81,0:21:22.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where have you been\Ncaptain, sir?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.48,0:21:25.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please tell us what\Nhappened to you at sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.81,0:21:33.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That damn Straw Hat\Nis the reason for all of this.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.54,0:21:37.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise that\NI will make him pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.59,0:21:42.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE B]\NUh... Captain Buggy,\Nsir... Who's the pretty lady?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.03,0:21:44.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the woman\Nwho saved my life
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.57,0:21:46.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and her name is...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.11,0:21:48.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.37,0:21:50.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know her name.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.81,0:21:53.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what was your name again?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.95,0:22:00.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CABAJI]\NAll right! The Buggy\NPirates are back together!
